            <div type="commentary" resp="#JP">
                <p>The fragment seems most likely to be a list of names in the nominative, with the indented word at line 2 perhaps the title of the office of agonothete (since personal names in  Ἀγων- are rare, and the indentation fits better as such a title, in a list. </p>
